  "steps": [
    "Muddle raspberries: Muddle the 4 fresh raspberries and 1/2 fluid ounce fresh lime juice in the bottom of a shaker until the raspberries break down.",
    "Combine ingredients: Add 2 fluid ounces vodka and 4 fluid ounces raspberry lemonade to the shaker along with ice.",
    "Shake: Shake well for about 10 seconds .",
    "Strain and serve: Double strain into a glass filled with fresh ice to catch the raspberry seeds. Garnish with a 1 lemon wheel, for garnish and 3 mint leaves, for garnish."
